I like some of the camera ideas...Would be particularly good when 
hallucinating.  Another possibility:

Your camera has a certain number of shots it can take.  The game keeps
a record of those monsters captured on film.  Escaping the dungeon
with monsters on film is worth extra points (possibly equal to the XPV
of the monsters--that is, 1/4 the value of killing them).  Kind of
like gems.  One asset of this idea is there is no way it could really
destroy game balance--it only allows you to increase your score;  it
doesn't make the game any easier to win.

